{{Skl|Foraging}} is one of the [[Skills]] available for players to level up as they perform certain actions in the game that grant them '''Foraging''' XP.

[[Roman Numerals]] are used to express its levels in-game.

Although '''Foraging''' goes from levels {{Green|1-57}}, {{Skill XP|+50 [[Foraging]]}} is required to reach the first level, meaning there is a "level 0", just like all the other [[Skills]].

