== Increasing Level Cap ==
Players can unlock additional levels beyond the default {{Skill|Foraging|50}} cap, granting more {{stat|str}}, {{Stat|Foraging Fortune}} and {{SBXP}}. These additional levels can be unlocked in any order. Currently, the highest obtainable {{skill|Foraging}} Skill level is {{Green|57}}.

=== Collections ===
Some {{skill|Foraging}} Level caps can be unlocked from reaching a certain [[Collection]] Milestone, such as {{Coll|Fig Log 9}} (requiring {{Item|Fig Log|amount=150000}}s), {{Coll|Mangrove Log 9}} (requiring {{Item|Mangrove Log|amount=150000}}s) and {{Coll|Helix Log 9}} (requiring {{Item|Helix Log|amount=250000}}s).

