== Ways to Boost XP Gain ==
{{Main|Foraging Wisdom}}
* An {{Item|Ocelot Pet}} can increase {{stat|foraging_wisdom}} by up to {{DarkAqua|30}}.
* The Efficient Forager node from {{Item|Heart of the Forest}} Tier 4 can provide {{DarkAqua|0.1-15}} {{stat|foraging_wisdom}} (+{{DarkAqua|0.1}} per level).
* A {{Item|Foraging XP Boost Potion}} (obtained from the {{Item|Season of Jerry}} event's Gifts) or a {{Item|God Potion}} can increase players' {{stat|foraging_wisdom}} by up to {{DarkAqua|20}}. 
** Note that while it is possible to upgrade tier {{Potion|Foraging XP Boost 1}} Potions to a '''{{Green|Tier 3}}''' potion while also extending its duration with an {{Item|Enchanted Redstone Lamp}}, it is not the best option due to it still having shorter duration than a {{Item|God Potion}}.
* Getting the {{ReforgingLink|Moonglade}} reforge on your axe can give {{Stat|Foraging Wisdom|+1/2/3/4/5/6}} depending on your axe's rarity, on top of also granting {{Stat|Foraging Fortune}}.
* A {{Item|Booster Cookie}} grants {{stat|foraging wisdom|25}}.

== Logger ==
{{AN|Logger}} is an ability exclusively unlocked by leveling up the {{Skill|Foraging}} Skill. Each Level of Logger grants {{Stat|Foraging Fortune|+4}}.

Each level of Foraging grants one level of {{AN|Logger}}. For example, at {{Skill|Foraging}} level {{Green|15}}, the player's {{AN|Logger}} is at level {{Green|15}}.

